const nav=[["/valves",Search,"Valve Search"],["/manufacturing",Activity,"Manufacturing"],["/actuators",Gauge,"Actuators"],["/brackets",Boxes,"Brackets"],["/admin",LayoutDashboard,"Dashboard"],["/admin/databases",Database,"Databases"],["/admin/display",PanelTop,"Display"],["/admin/users",Users,"Users"],["/admin/audit-log",FileClock,"Audit log"],["/admin/universal-adapters",Settings2,"Adapters"]] as const;
